        <Literal>The measured equipment status or equipment control command signal is switched between an &apos;on&apos; (logic high or 100% of the normal value) status and an &apos;off&apos; status (logic low or 0% of the normal value) frequently or irregularly.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
